{"variant": "minutes", "year": 1994, "month": 2, "day": 8, "slug": "legal/settlement-summary-8890", "variant_int": 4, "html": "<section class=\"page-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"text-uppercase mb-1\" style=\"color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem\"><a href=\"/archive/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">Archive</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/1994/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">1994</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/1994/02/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">02</a> &rsaquo; 08</p><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Meeting Minutes &bull; MIN-1994-02-9455</p><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25\">Technology Subcommittee of the Board — Settlement Summary</h1><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0\">1994-02-08 &bull; East Coast Regional Office, Boardroom</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:3rem 0;background:var(--surface)\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem\">Meeting Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem\"><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Committee</span><br><strong>Technology Subcommittee of the Board</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Date</span><br><strong>1994-02-08</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Location</span><br>East Coast Regional Office, Boardroom</div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-1994-02-9455</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">4 of 6 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Vani Quinn</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Enterprise Architecture</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Benefits Broker (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Micah Britt</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Legislative Affairs</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Chief Information Security Officer</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Bobby Resurreccion</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Diversity, Equity &amp; Inclusion</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Associate Vice President</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Curtis Celik</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Chief Product Officer</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Change Management Consultant (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Sola Michaels</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Ethics &amp; Compliance</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Expert Witness (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Workforce Analytics Platform Demo and Proposal</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee discussed the findings of the recent audit related to the Workforce Analytics Platform Demo and Proposal. Micah Britt summarized the 151 findings and management&#x27;s proposed remediation plan. The committee endorsed the plan and requested quarterly progress updates.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for optimization:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Technology Subcommittee of the Board approves the 1994 annual report on Form 10-K for filing with the SEC.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Micah Britt &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Curtis Celik</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 4 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Current Report on Form 8-K — Recent Filings</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Current Report on Form 8-K — Recent Filings, a proposal to adopt a new policy on transfer pricing. The policy was approved and will be implemented company-wide.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Relative TSR Performance Calculation and Payout Certification</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee received a report on the Relative TSR Performance Calculation and Payout Certification. The data indicated a negative trend that required immediate attention. The committee formed an ad hoc subcommittee to investigate the issue and report back with recommendations at the next meeting.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for vote:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Technology Subcommittee of the Board approves the 1994 annual report on Form 10-K for filing with the SEC.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Vani Quinn &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Sola Michaels</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 4 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Confirm vendor contract terms for benefits renewal and report back to committee chair</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Shilpa Shapiro</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1994-04-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Develop a plan for improving the company&#x27;s employer brand and reputation</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Gulsen Lowery</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1994-04-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Model the impact of a potential economic downturn on the company&#x27;s sales forecast</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Farah Nwachukwu</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1994-03-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a competitive assessment of Trident Consulting&#x27;s benefits package for the Trade Show &amp; Exhibition sector</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Alistair Tran</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1994-03-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">5</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Develop a plan for improving the company&#x27;s customer experience scores</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Fabiana Glover</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1994-03-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 4:45 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 1994-03-22</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Sola Michaels</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Director of Ethics &amp; Compliance, Expert Witness (External)</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/1994/02/07/digital-product-management-framework-4228/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&la